; DIMDIAMETER on the arc of an LWPOLYLINE (centre 20,10, radius 10) (PT27, #715).
; point15 (point1) is the point on the curve towards the location, point 10 (point2) the opposite one
; (autocad-quote.dxf, F3); text at the location, with bit 128 of group 70 (PT27, point 2).
PLINE
0,0
20,0
A
20,20

DIMDIAMETER
30,10
35,25
